# Per-line recording clips, cut from the film by dashboard/video/split-scenes.py. They are a
# derivative of two things that ARE committed -- reckn-demo-v3.mp4 and VO.md -- and they are
# regenerated whenever either moves, which today was six times. Committing them would put 13 MB
# of the same frames in the history on every take, and a stale clip is worse than no clip: it
# shows a line landing on a picture that has since changed.
